{"id":993,"date":"2025-05-12T12:32:10","date_gmt":"2025-05-12T10:32:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/services\/"},"modified":"2026-03-06T10:44:20","modified_gmt":"2026-03-06T09:44:20","slug":"servicios","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/fr\/servicios\/","title":{"rendered":"Services"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"993\" class=\"elementor elementor-993 elementor-34\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a0fc6c3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1a0fc6c3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35a6c66 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"35a6c66\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/playas-menorca.jpg?w=800\" title=\"\" alt=\"Playas de Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73945a88 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"73945a88\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"excursiones\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7299c6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e7299c6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf6f244 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cf6f244\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/excursiones-privadas.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-779\" alt=\"Excursions priv\u00e9es\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ebe6c30 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ebe6c30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Itin\u00e9raires exclusifs adapt\u00e9s \u00e0 vos int\u00e9r\u00eats, rythme et horaires<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-baa4cf7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"baa4cf7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f898a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f898a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Chez <strong>Voyager Menorca<\/strong>, nous pensons que chaque voyageur est unique et m\u00e9rite une exp\u00e9rience sur mesure. C'est pourquoi nous proposons des <g id=\"gid_1\">itin\u00e9raires exclusifs<\/g> con\u00e7us pour s'adapter \u00e0 vos int\u00e9r\u00eats, votre rythme et vos horaires. Que vous pr\u00e9f\u00e9riez d\u00e9couvrir des <strong>criques cach\u00e9es<\/strong>, explorer des <strong>monuments historiques<\/strong> ou vous immerger dans la <strong>culture locale<\/strong>, nous adapterons chaque parcours pour que vous viviez Minorque \u00e0 votre mani\u00e8re.  <\/p><p>Ces itin\u00e9raires sont parfaits pour les <strong>familles<\/strong> qui souhaitent profiter d'activit\u00e9s de plein air dans un environnement s\u00fbr et d\u00e9tendu&nbsp;; pour les <strong>couples<\/strong> qui recherchent des moments sp\u00e9ciaux dans des environnements naturels uniques&nbsp;; et pour les <strong>petits groupes<\/strong> qui appr\u00e9cient l'intimit\u00e9 et l'attention personnalis\u00e9e.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd51b61 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fd51b61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"tours\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be04ca8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be04ca8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67b11e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"67b11e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"86\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/tours-ciutadella-mao.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-780\" alt=\"Tours de Ciutadella et Ma\u00f3\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95d64a9 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"95d64a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">D\u00e9couvrez Ciutadella et Ma\u00f3&nbsp;: les joyaux urbains de Minorque<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a102e4a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a102e4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b86cc1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b86cc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Ciutadella<\/strong>, ancienne capitale de Minorque, est une ville pleine de charme. Ses ruelles pav\u00e9es, ses places historiques et ses b\u00e2timents nobles tels que le palais \u00e9piscopal et la cath\u00e9drale de Minorque t\u00e9moignent de son riche pass\u00e9. Pendant la visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les l\u00e9gendes et les anecdotes cach\u00e9es dans ses recoins, en profitant de l'authenticit\u00e9 de sa vieille ville et de l'animation du port.  <\/p><p>D'autre part, <strong>Ma\u00f3<\/strong> est une ville avec une essence tr\u00e8s diff\u00e9rente mais tout aussi captivante. Son imposant port naturel, l'un des plus grands de la M\u00e9diterran\u00e9e, contraste avec le r\u00e9seau urbain de maisons coloniales et de b\u00e2timents historiques tels que l'\u00e9glise de Santa Mar\u00eda et le mus\u00e9e de Minorque. Vous vous plongerez dans la culture locale, en d\u00e9couvrant des march\u00e9s, des caf\u00e9s traditionnels et des lieux embl\u00e9matiques qui refl\u00e8tent le caract\u00e8re cosmopolite de la ville.  <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a54eb50 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a54eb50\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72b04a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"72b04a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"579\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?fit=2000%2C579&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-853\" alt=\"Rincones de Menorca\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?resize=300%2C87&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?resize=1024%2C296&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?resize=768%2C222&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?resize=1536%2C445&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?resize=350%2C100&amp;ssl=1 350w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?w=1600 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ca0295 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7ca0295\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"naturaleza\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be99376 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be99376\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec78f65 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ec78f65\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"92\" height=\"92\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/naturaleza-cami-cavalls.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-781\" alt=\"Nature et Cam\u00ed de Cavalls\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c245f12 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c245f12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Nature et Cam\u00ed de Cavalls&nbsp;: Randonn\u00e9e \u00e0 Minorque<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-680d6a8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"680d6a8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6f2a49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e6f2a49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Vivez l'exp\u00e9rience de parcourir l&#8217;embl\u00e9matique <strong>Cam\u00ed de Cavalls<\/strong>, le mythique <strong>sentier qui fait le tour de l'\u00eele<\/strong>, parfait pour les amoureux de la nature et de la randonn\u00e9e. D\u00e9couvrez des \u00e9tapes inoubliables en traversant des criques vierges, des ravins escarp\u00e9s et des paysages de carte postale qui montrent le visage le plus authentique de Minorque. <\/p><p>Nous adaptons les itin\u00e9raires en fonction de votre rythme et de vos pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences, afin que vous profitiez de chaque tron\u00e7on de cette travers\u00e9e unique.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-699f99c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"699f99c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"patrimonio\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48318d8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"48318d8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e13e738 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e13e738\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/patrimonio-cultura-tradiciones.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-782\" alt=\"Patrimoine, culture et traditions\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1a488b animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f1a488b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Patrimoine, culture et traditions&nbsp;: l'essence de Minorque\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9578e70 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9578e70\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f53f0b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f53f0b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Minorque est bien plus que des plages et de la nature&nbsp;; son <strong>histoire et ses traditions<\/strong> font partie int\u00e9grante de son identit\u00e9. \u00c0 travers nos itin\u00e9raires culturels, vous d\u00e9couvrirez la <g id=\"gid_1\">Minorque talayotique<\/g>, avec ses imposants monuments pr\u00e9historiques, vestiges authentiques d'une civilisation mill\u00e9naire. Nous visiterons des sites embl\u00e9matiques tels que <strong>les taulas, les talayots et les navetas<\/strong>, tout en d\u00e9couvrant leur signification et leur lien avec la vie insulaire.  <\/p><p>De plus, nous explorerons le c\u00f4t\u00e9 le plus traditionnel de Minorque, en parcourant des villages ruraux o\u00f9 les m\u00e9tiers artisanaux sont encore pratiqu\u00e9s comme il y a des si\u00e8cles. Vous d\u00e9couvrirez l'essence de ses coutumes, de la fabrication de produits locaux aux festivit\u00e9s typiques qui refl\u00e8tent l'\u00e2me minorquine. Plongez dans un voyage culturel qui relie le pass\u00e9 au pr\u00e9sent, toujours guid\u00e9 par la passion et la connaissance de Daniel Vaquera.  <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6c46a0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d6c46a0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e9d1d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5e9d1d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rutas-guiadas-menorca.jpg?w=800\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fec23ee e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fec23ee\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"reserva\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b384df e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5b384df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69f3279 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"69f3279\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/reserva-biosfera-starlight.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-783\" alt=\"R\u00e9serve de biosph\u00e8re et Starlight\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d70eb5 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9d70eb5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">R\u00e9serve de biosph\u00e8re et Starlight&nbsp;: nature et ciels \u00e9toil\u00e9s de Minorque<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ee25d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ee25d9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee381c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ee381c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Minorque, d\u00e9clar\u00e9e <strong>r\u00e9serve de biosph\u00e8re par l'UNESCO<\/strong>, est un paradis naturel o\u00f9 la biodiversit\u00e9 c\u00f4toie des paysages uniques. Nous vous emm\u00e8nerons explorer ses espaces naturels prot\u00e9g\u00e9s, tels que les zones humides, les ravins et les zones c\u00f4ti\u00e8res, o\u00f9 la faune et la flore indig\u00e8nes s'\u00e9panouissent \u00e0 l'\u00e9tat pur. Profitez de visites guid\u00e9es qui relient nature et durabilit\u00e9 dans des environnements uniques.  <\/p><p>De plus, Minorque poss\u00e8de l'un des ciels les plus propres d'Europe, ce qui en fait une destination id\u00e9ale pour l'observation astronomique. Plongez dans l'<g id=\"gid_0\">exp\u00e9rience Starlight<\/g>, o\u00f9 vous d\u00e9couvrirez des constellations, des plan\u00e8tes et des \u00e9toiles sous une coupole c\u00e9leste impressionnante. Une combinaison parfaite de nature et d'astronomie pour profiter aussi bien de jour que de nuit.  <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5fdac2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c5fdac2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"traslados\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c6af6a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7c6af6a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95f4da5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"95f4da5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/traslados-aeropuerto.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-784\" alt=\"Transferts \u00e0 l&apos;a\u00e9roport\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19a1cbe animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"19a1cbe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elem